<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard | ProyectoProductos</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-page: #f4f7fb;
            --bg-card: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #1f2937;
            --text-soft: #6b7280;
            --border-soft: #e9eef5;
            --shadow-soft: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            --shadow-hover: 0 18px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.10);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--bg-page);
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-main);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .page-shell {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 18px 28px;
        }

        .dashboard-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .topbar {
            position: relative;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 30px 28px 24px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
        }

        .topbar-main {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .brand-box {
            width: 62px;
            height: 62px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d6efd, #3d8bfd);
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(13, 110, 253, 0.20);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .page-eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #0d6efd;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .topbar-title {
            font-size: 2.35rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }

        .topbar-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: var(--text-soft);
        }

        .user-panel {
            position: absolute;
            top: 22px;
            right: 22px;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .user-dropdown-btn {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e7edf5;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 9px 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 56px;
            min-width: 148px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .user-dropdown-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-color: #dbe5f0;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        }

        .user-avatar {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            min-width: 40px;
            min-height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center;
            display: block;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .user-avatar-fallback {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            min-width: 40px;
            min-height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #0d6efd;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .user-name {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .user-caret {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: var(--text-soft);
            opacity: 0.8;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .section-block {
            margin-top: 22px;
        }

        .section-heading {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .section-description {
            margin: 4px 0 0 0;
            color: var(--text-soft);
            font-size: 0.93rem;
        }

        .alert {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            margin-top: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 0;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 0.94rem;
        }

        .summary-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .summary-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            height: 100%;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .summary-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
        }

        .summary-card .card-body {
            padding: 18px 20px;
        }

        .summary-label {
            color: var(--text-soft);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .summary-value {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .summary-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .modules-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .module-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .module-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .module-card .card-body {
            padding: 26px 18px;
            min-height: 290px;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .module-icon {
            width: 78px;
            height: 78px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
        }

        .module-title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .module-text {
            color: var(--text-soft);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .btn-module {
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .dropdown-menu {
            min-width: 220px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 1400px) {
            .page-shell {
                padding-left: 12px;
                padding-right: 12px;
            }

            .dashboard-wrapper {
                max-width: 1650px;
            }

            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 18px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1199px) {
            .summary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 18px;
            }

            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 18px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 991px) {
            .page-shell {
                padding: 14px 12px 22px;
            }

            .topbar {
                padding: 86px 18px 20px;
            }

            .topbar-title {
                font-size: 1.9rem;
            }

            .topbar-subtitle {
                font-size: 0.92rem;
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .user-panel {
                top: 14px;
                right: 14px;
            }

            .user-dropdown-btn {
                min-height: 52px;
                min-width: 132px;
                padding: 8px 14px;
            }

            .summary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 14px;
            }

            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 14px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 767px) {
            .topbar {
                padding: 90px 16px 18px;
            }

            .topbar-title {
                font-size: 1.75rem;
            }

            .page-eyebrow {
                font-size: 0.72rem;
                letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            }

            .brand-box {
                width: 56px;
                height: 56px;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }

            .summary-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .module-card .card-body {
                padding: 22px 16px;
                min-height: auto;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .page-shell {
                padding: 10px 8px 18px;
            }

            .topbar {
                border-radius: 20px;
                padding: 86px 14px 16px;
            }

            .user-panel {
                top: 12px;
                right: 12px;
            }

            .user-dropdown-btn {
                min-height: 48px;
                min-width: 124px;
                padding: 7px 12px;
                gap: 8px;
            }

            .user-avatar,
            .user-avatar-fallback {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                min-width: 34px;
                min-height: 34px;
            }

            .user-name {
                font-size: 0.88rem;
            }

            .topbar-title {
                font-size: 1.45rem;
            }

            .topbar-subtitle {
                font-size: 0.88rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

            .section-description {
                font-size: 0.88rem;
            }

            .summary-card .card-body {
                padding: 16px 16px;
            }

            .summary-value {
                font-size: 1.85rem;
            }

            .summary-icon {
                width: 46px;
                height: 46px;
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .module-icon {
                width: 68px;
                height: 68px;
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .module-title {
                font-size: 1.08rem;
            }

            .module-text {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }

            .btn-module {
                font-size: 0.92rem;
                padding: 10px 14px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <div class="dashboard-wrapper">

            <div class="topbar">
                <div class="user-panel">
                    <% if (typeof usuarioSesion !== 'undefined' && usuarioSesion) { %>
                        <div class="dropdown">
                            <a
                                href="#"
                                class="user-dropdown-btn text-decoration-none"
                                data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                                aria-expanded="false"
                            >
                                <% if (usuarioSesion.Foto) { %>
                                    <img
                                        src="<%= usuarioSesion.Foto %>"
                                        alt="Foto de perfil"
                                        class="user-avatar"
                                    >
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <div class="user-avatar user-avatar-fallback">
                                        <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
                                    </div>
                                <% } %>

                                <span class="user-name"><%= usuarioSesion.NombreUsuario %></span>
                                <i class="bi bi-chevron-down user-caret"></i>
                            </a>

                            <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end shadow-sm border-0 rounded-4">
                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item py-2" href="/perfil">
                                        <i class="bi bi-person me-2"></i>Mi perfil
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a class="dropdown-item py-2 text-danger" href="/auth/logout">
                                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i>Cerrar sesión
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                </div>

                <div class="topbar-main">
                    <div class="brand-box">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="page-eyebrow">Sistema de inventario</div>
                        <h1 class="topbar-title">ProyectoProductos</h1>
                        <p class="topbar-subtitle">
                            Panel principal para la gestión de productos, proveedores, distribución, salidas y reportes.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            

            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div class="alert alert-danger"><%= error %></div>
            <% } %>

            <section class="section-block">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line text-primary"></i>
                        Resumen general
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-description">
                        Vista rápida del estado actual del inventario y las operaciones registradas.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="summary-grid">
                    <div>
                        <div class="card summary-card">
                            <div class="card-body d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="summary-label">Productos</p>
                                    <h3 class="summary-value"><%= resumen.TotalProductos %></h3>
                                </div>
                                <div class="summary-icon bg-primary-subtle text-primary">
                                    <i class="bi bi-box"></i>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card summary-card">
                            <div class="card-body d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="summary-label">Proveedores</p>
                                    <h3 class="summary-value"><%= resumen.TotalProveedores %></h3>
                                </div>
                                <div class="summary-icon bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                    <i class="bi bi-truck"></i>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card summary-card">
                            <div class="card-body d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="summary-label">Distribuciones</p>
                                    <h3 class="summary-value"><%= resumen.TotalRelaciones %></h3>
                                </div>
                                <div class="summary-icon bg-warning-subtle text-warning">
                                    <i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card summary-card">
                            <div class="card-body d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="summary-label">Stock total</p>
                                    <h3 class="summary-value"><%= resumen.StockTotal %></h3>
                                </div>
                                <div class="summary-icon bg-info-subtle text-info">
                                    <i class="bi bi-stack"></i>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-grid-1x2-fill text-primary"></i>
                        Módulos del sistema
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-description">
                        Accede a cada área funcional del sistema de inventario de forma organizada y rápida.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="modules-grid">
                    <div>
                        <div class="card module-card">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="module-icon bg-primary-subtle text-primary">
                                        <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h5 class="module-title">Productos</h5>
                                    <p class="module-text">
                                        Administra el catálogo completo de productos, controla existencias y mantiene actualizado el inventario general del sistema.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/productos" class="btn btn-primary btn-module">Ir al módulo</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card module-card">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="module-icon bg-success-subtle text-success">
                                        <i class="bi bi-people"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h5 class="module-title">Proveedores</h5>
                                    <p class="module-text">
                                        Gestiona la información de proveedores, facilita el control de contactos y fortalece la relación con el abastecimiento.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/proveedores" class="btn btn-success btn-module">Ir al módulo</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card module-card">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="module-icon bg-warning-subtle text-warning">
                                        <i class="bi bi-shuffle"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h5 class="module-title">Distribución</h5>
                                    <p class="module-text">
                                        Registra movimientos de entrada y distribución interna para actualizar automáticamente la disponibilidad de stock.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/distribucion" class="btn btn-warning text-white btn-module">Ir al módulo</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card module-card border-danger-subtle">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="module-icon bg-danger-subtle text-danger">
                                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h5 class="module-title">Salida de Productos</h5>
                                    <p class="module-text">
                                        Controla los egresos del inventario, valida existencias disponibles y mantiene trazabilidad de cada salida registrada.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/salidas" class="btn btn-danger btn-module">Ir al módulo</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <div class="card module-card">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="module-icon bg-info-subtle text-info">
                                        <i class="bi bi-bar-chart"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <h5 class="module-title">Reportes</h5>
                                    <p class="module-text">
                                        Consulta información consolidada del sistema mediante tablas, estadísticas y visualizaciones para apoyar decisiones.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="/reportes" class="btn btn-info text-white btn-module">Ir al módulo</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>